      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.15,
      "end_seconds": 223.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "just my appendix out, about eight years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 224.56,
      "end_seconds": 226.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "are you active at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.67,
      "end_seconds": 230.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Barely, I'm mostly sedentary these days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.17,
      "end_seconds": 234.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Are you living with family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.37,
      "end_seconds": 239.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "I stay with my daughter and her family."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.49,
      "end_seconds": 244.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Alright what kind of work do you do?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.46,
      "end_seconds": 249.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "I work on a farm, it's quite physical."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.86,
      "end_seconds": 263.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.26,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.7,
      "end_seconds": 268.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Paracetamol i take it 500 milligrams, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.2,
      "end_seconds": 277.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.67,
      "text": "do you have any medical conditions I should know about? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.88,
      "end_seconds": 282.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.84,
      "end_seconds": 291.48,
      "duration_seconds": 7.64,
      "text": "Having listened and examined I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at post-viral fatigue or a thyroid problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.05,
      "end_seconds": 296.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "what are the chances it's something bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 299.66,
      "end_seconds": 312.07,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like post-viral fatigue, but I'd like to confirm. I think blood tests makes sense here, for fatigue"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 314.0,
      "end_seconds": 315.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "okay, that's fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.76,
      "end_seconds": 328.82,
      "duration_seconds": 12.06,
      "text": "Pace yourself, a little more activity each day but stop before you're wiped out. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 329.71,
      "end_seconds": 331.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "okay, I'll remember"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.32,
      "end_seconds": 334.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Book a review in four weeks."
    },
